# Iron Hills Stalwart: "When this creature enters, attach target Equipment you control to up to one target creature you
# control" (CR 701.3a). Bot1's Paradise Mantle is on its Ornithopter; the Stalwart's trigger moves it onto the Stalwart
# itself, a creature Bot1 controls. The opponent's Paradise Mantle and Memnite (cast on turn 2) are refused as targets
# (CR 115.1, "you control"), and reach and trample are the Stalwart's own.

